DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
11941::$$$message_0095_0000_0000$$$::There's no one at the chapel.[lr]::
11942::$$$message_0095_0000_0001$$$::Kirei Kotomine, the head priest, passed away... Well, it was treated as a disappearance to the general public and a succeeding priest came. But that priest also returned to their country, so the church is under a lockdown.::
11943::$$$message_0095_0001_0000$$$::"...All right."[lr]::
11944::$$$message_0095_0001_0001$$$::I sit on the bench and rest my body.[lr]::
11945::$$$message_0095_0001_0002$$$::When I'm by myself like this, a lot of piled up questions start to arise.::
11946::$$$message_0095_0002_0000$$$::There's several things I have to think about.[lr]::
11947::$$$message_0095_0002_0001$$$::Within those things, what I have to prioritize most right now is...[lr]::
11948::$$$message_0095_0002_0002$$$::"It's what you're forgetting, right?"[wdash canskip=0][lr]::
11949::$$$message_0095_0002_0003$$$::The golden-haired boy standing at the altar says.::
11950::$$$message_0095_0003_0000$$$::"You..."[lr]::
11951::$$$message_0095_0003_0001$$$::"Hello. You were frowning, so I came to help."[lr]::
11952::$$$message_0095_0003_0002$$$::He slowly walks towards me.[lr]::
11953::$$$message_0095_0003_0003$$$::He closely resembles the priest that was once at this altar.[sestop time=1000 nowait=true][lr]::
11954::$$$message_0095_0003_0004$$$::He guesses my worries accurately and exposes the truth that I don't even want to know.::
11955::$$$message_0095_0004_0000$$$::"I'm forgetting something, huh? Do you know?"[lr]::
11956::$$$message_0095_0004_0001$$$::"I do. Saber and Sakura must also be wondering why you are slacking off."[lr]::
11957::$$$message_0095_0004_0002$$$::Slacking off...?[lr]::
11958::$$$message_0095_0004_0003$$$::Well it's not like I'm enthusiastically trying to pursue the truth, but I feel like slacking off has a different meaning...::
11959::$$$message_0095_0005_0000$$$::"What do you mean by 'slacking off'?"[lr]::
11960::$$$message_0095_0005_0001$$$::"It's your daily routine. You're not using your magecraft at all. Have you trained in the shed at all since we've gotten into this situation?"::
11961::$$$message_0095_0006_0000$$$::"No, that's just..."[lr]::
11962::$$$message_0095_0006_0001$$$::Because I didn't know how to use it, or I didn't have the opportunity to try it out.[lr]::
11963::$$$message_0095_0006_0002$$$::Hearing him say that makes me think back and wonder if that was really the case.::
11964::$$$message_0095_0007_0000$$$::"That is what's important. The fact that you don't try it because you don't have the opportunity in itself is weird for someone who trains as much as you do."[lr]::
11965::$$$message_0095_0007_0001$$$::"...Mrgh. I see, you're right."::
11966::$$$message_0095_0008_0000$$$::Just as the boy says, the fact that Shirou Emiya isn't training is weird in itself.[lr]::
11967::$$$message_0095_0008_0001$$$::So that's what the abnormality is.[lr]::
11968::$$$message_0095_0008_0002$$$::The problem is why I forgot about such a basic routine.[lr]::
11969::$$$message_0095_0008_0003$$$::If there was something like an enemy... Is that abnormality itself the magecraft that the enemy cast?::
11970::$$$message_0095_0009_0000$$$::"I forgot about magecraft training itself... So does that mean I'm not able to use Strengthening anymore?"[lr]::
11971::$$$message_0095_0009_0001$$$::"You will always be able to. You just forgot your skill and just weren't using it.[lr]::
11972::$$$message_0095_0009_0002$$$::Humans can generally manage with what they know, but they can't step into unknown territory. They don't know, so they can't do it."::
11973::$$$message_0095_0010_0000$$$::"[fadein textoff=0 time=100 storage=white][fg textoff=0 left=0 index=2000 top=0 time=100 storage=i土蔵内(fd)-(深夜)]Oh, [cacheimage storage=white,08魔力回路c,b15,a05b(ぼやけ)][wvl][fadein textoff=0 time=100 storage=white][fg textoff=0 left=0 index=3000 top=0 time=100 storage=08魔力回路c][line len=1][fadein textoff=0 time=100 storage=white][fg textoff=0 left=0 index=4000 top=0 time=100 storage=b15][line len=1][fadein textoff=0 time=100 storage=white][fg textoff=0 left=0 index=5000 top=0 time=100 storage=a05b(ぼやけ)][line len=1][cacheimage storage=white,19瞑想時の剣,i言峰教会礼拝堂][wvl][fadein textoff=0 time=100 storage=white][fg textoff=0 left=0 index=6000 top=0 time=100 storage=19瞑想時の剣]ah."[fadein textoff=0 time=100 storage=i言峰教会礼拝堂][lr]::
11974::$$$message_0095_0010_0001$$$::The gears start turning.[lr]::
11975::$$$message_0095_0010_0002$$$::The function that just existed and wasn't working slowly starts moving.::
11976::$$$message_0095_0011_0000$$$::"That's right. I haven't lost my Magic Circuits. If I feel like it, then I can fight back."[lr]::
11977::$$$message_0095_0011_0001$$$::The option of fighting is what I had forgotten about.[lr]::
11978::$$$message_0095_0011_0002$$$::The training that only the mage known as Shirou Emiya has and others can't copy or don't know about.::
11979::$$$message_0095_0012_0000$$$::"Yes. But trying it out without using it once would be suicidal. Please do not forget to practice it at your usual spot."[lr]::
11980::$$$message_0095_0012_0001$$$::He must've said what he wanted to say.[sestop time=6000 nowait=1][lr]::
11981::$$$message_0095_0012_0002$$$::The boy steps away from the altar just like the priest.::
11982::$$$message_0095_0013_0000$$$::"...Thanks for the advice.[lr]::
11983::$$$message_0095_0013_0001$$$::But is that okay? You were told not to meddle much, right?"::
11984::$$$message_0095_0014_0000$$$::"Mm, not really. I will probably get in trouble. She's scary when she's mad.[lr]::
11985::$$$message_0095_0014_0001$$$::Before, she would make me cranky out of spite, but now she would simply ignore me. It's pretty tough. Porca miseria."::
11986::$$$message_0095_0015_0000$$$::"Huh?? Porca what??"[lr]::
11987::$$$message_0095_0015_0001$$$::"It's slang. She wasn't raised properly."[lr]::
11988::$$$message_0095_0015_0002$$$::He's not making any sense.[lr]::
11989::$$$message_0095_0015_0003$$$::The Goldy went up the stairs, his gestures still gloomy.::
11990::$$$message_0095_0016_0000$$$::"...Well, I moved a step forward, so it's fine."[lr]::
11991::$$$message_0095_0016_0001$$$::The fundamental thing that I had forgotten.[lr]::
11992::$$$message_0095_0016_0002$$$::I remembered the only weapon, no, the fact that Shirou Emiya had a weapon.[lr]::
11993::$$$message_0095_0016_0003$$$::I'll try reenacting my daily routine during my free time.::
911951::$$$message_9095_0003_0001$$$::"Hello. You were frowning, so I came to help."[r]::

